  m_Name: 22_Sally_taga_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Sally
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Now you can answer that question yourself.

    In Ilokano, ''taga
    ___ ak'' means ''I am from ___.''

    The phrase ''taga'' introduces the place
    you come from, while the location changes depending on your answer.

    For
    example: ''taga Vigan ak.''

    Listen carefully: taga Vigan ak.

    Now, try
    saying ''taga'' followed by your hometown.'
